# AI / ML

- Read `docs/ML.md`. Two modules only: Model A (activity gap-fill), Model B (rank alternatives).
- Model A returns filled activity fields + `data_source: modeled`. Never use a net for official `total_co2e_kg`.
- Model B proposes `recommendation_action_type` enums. `delta_co2e_kg` comes from re-running the engine.
- Emit the same JSON as `fixtures/recommendations.json`. UI calls FastAPI, not ML URLs directly.
- P2 LLM chatbot: tool-call existing GET APIs only; do not invent tonnes.
